{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ(ؔᵒ̶̷ᵕؔᵒ̷̶)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/02/24/7059859/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のBIRTHDAY LIVE、\n来てくれた方本当にありがとう(* ˆωˆ *)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてもいい思い出になりました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにより、LIVEしてて、自分が1番楽しくて！\n終わった後の達成感が半端なくて！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう終わりたくない、まだLIVEしていたい。\nっていうのが本音でした☻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"武道館の反省も活かせて\nすこし自分自身が成長できたかなと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/02/24/7059859/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/02/24/7059859/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/02/24/7059859/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MCでは、なんと、\n横アリの皆さんと一緒に「斎藤家のうた」を大合唱！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌詞だけであんなに歌えるなんて\nみなさん流石です☻！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか全体がひとつになれた気がしました(* ˆωˆ *)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの一体感は忘れません！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/02/24/7059859/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱぱ達も嬉しがってたよ☻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの調子だと3番も作っちゃいそう(ؔᵒ̶̷ᵕؔᵒ̷̶)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に、最高の1日をありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/02/24/7059859/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日おめでとう乃木坂46！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしていつもありがとう乃木坂ファミリーの皆様！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(Ӧ)(ӧ)(Ӧ)(Ӧ)(ӧ)〜♬(Ӧ)(ӧ)(Ӧ)(Ӧ)(ӧ)〜♬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブが終わり、ひと段落！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かと思いきや、\nもうすぐ学年末試験が......(..)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8thの制作や、ライブのリハで思うように勉強ができてないから\n合間合間に少しづつ勉強も頑張っていきます( ´_ゝ`)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそしてプリンシパル3！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決まったことだし、\n頑張ることばっかりだ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のライブに来れなかった方は\nメンバーのいつもとはひと味違った表情がみられる\nプリンシパルに来て見てください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からの学校ももちろん頑張ります☻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2014/02/24/7059859/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から始まったモバメ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからどんどん送っていきたいと思うので\n待っていてください☻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´>∀<｀)ゝ"}],"source":"archive"}